      <div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Is there a Forage alternative recruiters actually see?</div><div class="faq-a">Most options stop at a credential the recruiter never opens. Coursera reports about 168 million registered learners, so a single course certificate signals almost nothing on its own. The thing to look for is whether recruiters use the platform to find candidates by their proven work. On zero, recruiters pay to access students who have already produced scored work, so the evidence reaches the people who hire.</div></div>
